---
config:
    theme: redux-dark-color
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sender
    participant MessagingAPI@{ "type": "boundary" }
    participant DataStore@{ "type": "database" }
    actor Recipient

    Note over Sender,Recipient: One send path serves a DM (single recipient) and a channel message (all members).

    Sender->>MessagingAPI: Send message: body, target handle or channel, session token
    MessagingAPI->>DataStore: Validate session, for a channel, check membership
    DataStore-->>MessagingAPI: Session and membership state

    alt Session invalid or expired
        MessagingAPI-->>Sender: 401 Unauthorized, nothing Datastored
    else Not a member of the channel
        MessagingAPI-->>Sender: 403 Forbidden, nothing Datastored
    else Authorized
        MessagingAPI->>DataStore: Persist with sequence number and UTC timestamp
        DataStore-->>MessagingAPI: Message ID and sequence
        MessagingAPI-->>Sender: Accepted, state Sent

        loop Each connected recipient
            MessagingAPI->>Recipient: Push message with sequence and timestamp
        end

        Note over MessagingAPI,Recipient: Offline recipients are not pushed to, the message stays Datastored.
    end

    Recipient->>MessagingAPI: Request conversation history on reconnect
    MessagingAPI->>DataStore: Read messages ordered by sequence
    DataStore-->>MessagingAPI: DataStored messages
    MessagingAPI-->>Recipient: Chronological history (FR-07)
